      "writtenOn": "2023-11-21T00:06:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmmm - I still think that all core HALs should be in the systems instance. Do we hae a case that\u0027s not? I don\u0027t understand why this is coupled with the package-level check.\n\nCan you ping me to discuss this week?",
      "parentUuid": "ff24a7b9_2bdbcd1b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "f4e2519fffae7bc9094ac941bef011ceb535e392",
